      "end_seconds": 10.53,
      "duration_seconds": 9.22,
      "text": "let me think, um, hello doctor, sorry, I took a wrong turn on the way here"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.34,
      "end_seconds": 16.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "yes, have a seat tell me what's going on"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 18.19,
      "end_seconds": 24.76,
      "duration_seconds": 6.57,
      "text": "good afternoon, doctor i look after them so I thought I'd come"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.82,
      "end_seconds": 30.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Please do. Extra information is always welcome."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.67,
      "end_seconds": 38.59,
      "duration_seconds": 6.92,
      "text": "Ah, um, so the thing is, I've got spots on my face."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.02,
      "end_seconds": 42.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.26,
      "end_seconds": 47.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "it's been going on for two months"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.71,
      "end_seconds": 50.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "Is it accompanied by anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.58,
      "end_seconds": 59.41,
      "duration_seconds": 6.83,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get spots on my back as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.7,
      "end_seconds": 64.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "alright, have you been feeling low about your skin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.08,
      "end_seconds": 84.87,
      "duration_seconds": 18.79,
      "text": "yes, I have okay, so with feeling low about my skin, I'd call it severe the spots on my back? That's been for six months uh, about spots on my back, I'd call it severe"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.5,
      "end_seconds": 90.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "Have you noticed headaches or excess hair growth?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.17,
      "end_seconds": 96.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "I haven't had headaches or excess hair growth, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.36,
      "end_seconds": 100.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "And what about fever or joint pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.08,
      "end_seconds": 106.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "No, you know, none of those at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.61,
      "end_seconds": 111.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.39,
      "end_seconds": 113.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "nothing odd there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.45,
      "end_seconds": 117.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "Is your mobility otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.41,
      "end_seconds": 121.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.47,
      "end_seconds": 126.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.16,
      "end_seconds": 130.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "no, not that I know of"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.31,
      "end_seconds": 134.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Do you work outside the home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.7,
      "end_seconds": 139.56,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "text": "I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.92,
      "end_seconds": 142.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Do you get out much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.51,
      "end_seconds": 148.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.12,
      "end_seconds": 157.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.67,
      "end_seconds": 162.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.57,
      "end_seconds": 180.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 181.94,
      "end_seconds": 190.11,
      "duration_seconds": 8.17,
      "text": "mm, she is on omeprazole, 20 milligrams, once a day, I give it to her"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.63,
      "end_seconds": 192.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "I see, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 194.51,
      "end_seconds": 200.92,
      "duration_seconds": 6.41,
      "text": "She is on face wash, twice a day, I give it to her."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.23,
      "end_seconds": 217.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.52,
      "end_seconds": 223.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "yeah, I have anxiety, for about ten years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.81,
      "end_seconds": 229.51,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 230.2,
      "end_seconds": 234.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "I have acid reflux, for about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.38,
      "end_seconds": 244.09,
      "duration_seconds": 8.71,
      "text": "Yes, acid reflux is known to us, good to have that clear. Shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.98,
      "end_seconds": 253.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.8,
      "end_seconds": 271.38,
      "duration_seconds": 6.58,
      "text": "okay: SpO2 99 percent on room air, heart rate 75, BP is 127 over 80."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.48,
      "end_seconds": 275.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "May I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.44,
      "end_seconds": 277.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.81,
      "end_seconds": 302.72,
      "duration_seconds": 6.91,
      "text": "There are red inflamed lumps and blackheads over both cheeks and the forehead, and a few scars."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.53,
      "end_seconds": 316.45,
      "duration_seconds": 10.92,
      "text": "you can relax now so, based on the history and the the examination, I can't pin this down yet we're looking at moderate inflammatory acne or rosacea"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 317.54,
      "end_seconds": 320.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 322.32,
      "end_seconds": 333.3,
      "duration_seconds": 10.98,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's moderate inflammatory acne, and we'll know more once the blood tests is back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 345.39,
      "end_seconds": 364.39,
      "duration_seconds": 19.0,
      "text": "I'll request blood tests, it'll help with acne treatment baseline. The The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed. Let's use adapalene gel, 0.1 percent, once a night, for twelve weeks. It's for acne."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 365.15,
      "end_seconds": 366.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "That's simple enough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 368.3,
      "end_seconds": 379.99,
      "duration_seconds": 11.69,
      "text": "use sunscreen daily, and the gel can sting for the first couple of weeks let's plan a check in twelve weeks i think we're done unless you have questions"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 381.24,
      "end_seconds": 385.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "Oh, good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    }
  ]
}